SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5 charge
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    C(4) 5e-4
    Mn 1e-3

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 10.0 1.0
        -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_kinetics.sel
    -reset false
    -time true
    -molalities C
    -step true
    -high_precision true
